hadiths[46]{hadithnumber,text}:
"8","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Islam paanch (cheezon) par buna gaya hai: Is baat ki gawahi ke Allah key siwa koi mabood nahi aur Muhammad Allah key Rasool hain, aur namaz qaem karna, aur zakat dena, aur hajj karna, aur Ramazan key rozey rakhna. (Bukhari: 8)"
"9","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Imaan saath (60) se zyada shaakhon wala hai, aur haya imaan ki aik shaakh hai. (Bukhari: 9)"
"10","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Amr (Raziallahu anhuma) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Musalman wo hai jiski zabaan aur haath se Musalman mehfooz rahein, aur muhaajir wo hai jo us cheez ko chhor dey jis se Allah ne mana kya hai. (Bukhari: 10)"
"11","[AI-translation] Abu Musa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Logon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Kaunsa Islam afzal hai? Aap ne farmaya: Jis (Musalman) ki zabaan aur haath se Musalman mehfooz rahein. (Bukhari: 11)"
"12","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Amr (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke aik aadmi ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se poochha: Kaunsa Islam behtar hai? Aap ne farmaya: Tum khaana khilao, aur jisey tum jaantey ho aur jisey tum nahi jaantey (sab ko) salaam karo. (Bukhari: 12)"
"13","[AI-translation] Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Tum mein se koi shakhs imaan nahi rakhta yahan tak ke apne bhai key liye wahi pasand karey jo apne liye pasand karta hai. (Bukhari: 13)"
"14","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: To qasam us zaat ki jiskey haath mein meri jaan hai! Tum mein se koi shakhs imaan nahi rakhta yahan tak ke main usey uskey waalid aur uski aulaad se zyada mehboob ho jaaun. (Bukhari: 14)"
"15","[AI-translation] Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum mein se koi shakhs imaan nahi rakhta yahan tak ke main usey uskey waalid aur uski aulaad aur tamaam logon se zyada mehboob ho jaaun. (Bukhari: 15)"
"16","[AI-translation] Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Teen (khaslatein) hain jo jis mein hon us ne imaan ki mithaas paa li: Ye ke Allah aur uska Rasool usey unkey siwa har cheez se zyada mehboob hon, aur ye ke wo aadmi se mohabbat karey to sirf Allah key liye mohabbat karey, aur ye ke wo kufr mein lautney ko aisa naapasand karey jaisa wo aag mein phenkey jaaney ko naapasand karta hai. (Bukhari: 16)"
"17","[AI-translation] Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Imaan ki nishaani Ansaar se mohabbat hai, aur nifaaq ki nishaani Ansaar se bughz hai. (Bukhari: 17)"
"18","[AI-translation] Ubada bin Saamit (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya jabke Aap key gird Aap key sahaaba ki aik jamaat thi: Mujh se baiat karo is par ke tum Allah key sath kisi cheez ko shareek na karogey, aur na chori karogey, aur na zina karogey, aur na apni aulaad ko qatl karogey, aur na aisa bohtaan laaogey jo tum apne haathon aur pairon key darmiyaan ghado, aur na neki mein naafarmaani karogey. Phir tum mein se jo poora karey to uska ajr Allah par hai, aur jo in mein se kuchh kar baithay phir duniya mein us par saza di jaey to wo uskey liye kaffaara hai, aur jo in mein se kuchh kar baithay phir Allah usey chhupa dey to wo Allah (key supurd) hai, agar chaahey to usey maaf kar dey aur agar chaahey to usey azaab dey. To ham ne Aap se us par baiat ki. (Bukhari: 18)"
"19","[AI-translation] Abu Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Qareeb hai ke Musalman ka behtareen maal bakriyaan hon jinhey ley kar wo pahaadon ki chotiyon aur baarish barasney ki jaghon par jaey, fitnon se apne deen ko bachata hua. (Bukhari: 19)"
"20","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab unhey (logon ko) hukm detey to aamaal mein se utney ka hukm detey jitni wo taaqat rakhtey. Unhon-ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Ham Aap jaisey nahi hain, beshak Allah ne Aap key agley aur pichhley gunaah maaf kar diye hain. To Aap ghussa hotey yahan tak ke ghussa Aap key chehrey mein pehchaana jaata, phir farmatey: Beshak tum mein sab se zyada muttaqi aur Allah ko jaanney wala main hun. (Bukhari: 20)"
"21","[AI-translation] Abu Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Jannat waley Jannat mein daakhil hongey aur aag waley aag mein, phir Allah Taala farmaaeyga: Aag se unhey nikaal do jiskey dil mein raai key daaney key baraabar imaan tha. To wo us se nikaaley jaaengey jabke wo jal chukey hongey, phir wo Nahar-e-Haya ya Nahar-e-Hayaat mein daaley jaaengey, Maalik ko shak hua, to wo ugengey jaisey daana sailaab key kinaarey ugta hai. Kya tum ne nahi dekha ke wo zard murjhaai hui nikalti hai. (Bukhari: 22)"
"22","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Abu Saeed Khudri Raziallahu anhu se) riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jabke main soya hua tha main ne logon ko dekha jo mujh par pesh kiye jaa rahey they aur un par qameezein thein, un mein se kuchh seenon tak pahunchti thein aur un mein se kuchh us se neechey, aur mujh par Umar bin Khattab pesh kiye gaey jabke un par aik qameez thi jisey wo ghaseet rahey they. Unhon-ne kaha: To Ya Rasulullah! Aap ne uski kya taabeer ki? Aap ne farmaya: Deen ki. (Bukhari: 23)"
"23","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Ansaar key aik aadmi key paas se guzrey jabke wo haya key baarey mein apne bhai ko naseehat kar raha tha. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Usey chhor do, beshak haya imaan mein se hai. (Bukhari: 24)"
"24","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma se) riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mujhey hukm diya gaya hai ke main logon se qitaal karun yahan tak ke wo gawahi dein ke Allah key siwa koi mabood nahi aur Muhammad Allah key Rasool hain, aur namaz qaem karein aur zakat dein. Phir jab wo ye kar lein to unhon-ne mujh se apney khoon aur apney maal mehfooz kar liye magar Islam key haq key sath, aur unka hisaab Allah par hai. (Bukhari: 25)"
"25","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se poochha gaya: Kaunsa amal afzal hai? To Aap ne farmaya: Allah aur uskey Rasool par imaan. Kaha gaya: Phir kya? Aap ne farmaya: Allah key raastey mein jihaad. Kaha gaya: Phir kya? Aap ne farmaya: Hajj-e-Mabroor. (Bukhari: 26)"
"26","[AI-translation] Saad bin Abi Waqqaas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik jamaat ko (maal) diya jabke Saad baithey huey they. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik aadmi ko chhor diya jo unhey (Saad ko) un sab mein sab se zyada pasand tha. To main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Aap ko fulaan se kya (rukawat) hai? To Allah ki qasam! Beshak main usey momin samajhta hun. To Aap ne farmaya: Ya Musalmaan. To main thodi der khaamosh raha, phir jo main uskey baarey mein jaanta tha wo mujh par ghaalib aa gaya, to main apni baat par lauta aur main ne kaha: Aap ko fulaan se kya hai? To Allah ki qasam! Beshak main usey momin samajhta hun. To Aap ne farmaya: Ya Musalmaan. Phir jo main uskey baarey mein jaanta tha wo mujh par ghaalib aa gaya to main apni baat par lauta aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) bhi (apni baat par) lautey, phir farmaya: Ae Saad! Beshak main aadmi ko deta hun jabke doosra mujhey us se zyada mehboob hota hai, is khauf se ke Allah usey aag mein aundhey munh daal dey. (Bukhari: 27)"
"27","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mujhey aag dikhaai gai to (main ne dekha ke) us mein rehne walon mein aksar auratein hain, wo naashukri karti hain. Kaha gaya: Kya wo Allah ki naashukri karti hain? Aap ne farmaya: Wo shohar ki naashukri karti hain aur ehsaan ki naashukri karti hain. Agar tum un mein se kisi se zamaana bhar ehsaan karo phir wo tum se kuchh (naagawaar) dekhey to kahegi: Main ne tum se kabhi koi bhalai nahi dekhi. (Bukhari: 29)"
"28","[AI-translation] Abu Zarr (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Beshak main ne aik aadmi ko gaali di aur usey uski maan ka taana diya. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujh se farmaya: Ae Abu Zarr! Kya tum ne usey uski maan ka taana diya? Beshak tum aisey aadmi ho jis mein jaahiliyat hai. Tumharey bhai tumharey khaadim hain, Allah ne unhey tumharey haathon key neechey kar diya hai. Phir jis ka bhai uskey haath key neechey ho to usey us mein se khilaaey jo wo khaata hai aur usey us mein se pehnaaey jo wo pehenta hai, aur unhey aisi takleef na do jo un par ghaalib aa jaey. Phir agar tum unhey takleef do to unki madad karo. (Bukhari: 30)"
"29","[AI-translation] Abu Bakra (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Jab do Musalman apni talwaaron key sath milein to qaatil aur maqtool (donon) aag mein hain. To main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Ye to qaatil hai, phir maqtool ka kya haal hai? Aap ne farmaya: Beshak wo apne saathi ko qatl karney ka harees tha. (Bukhari: 31)"
"30","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Jab (ye aayat) naazil hui: (Jo log imaan laaey aur unhon-ne apne imaan mein zulm na milaaya), to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sahaaba ne kaha: Ham mein se kaun hai jis ne zulm na kya ho? To Allah ne naazil farmaya: (Beshak shirk bada zulm hai). (Bukhari: 32)"
"31","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Munaafiq ki nishaani teen hain: Jab baat karey to jhoot boley, aur jab waada karey to khilaaf karey, aur jab usey amaanat di jaey to khiyaanat karey. (Bukhari: 33)"
"32","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Amr (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Chaar (khaslatein) hain jo jis mein hon wo khaalis munaafiq tha, aur jis mein un mein se aik khaslat ho us mein nifaaq ki aik khaslat hogi yahan tak ke usey chhor dey: Jab usey amaanat di jaey to khiyaanat karey, aur jab baat karey to jhoot boley, aur jab ahd karey to dhoka dey, aur jab jhagda karey to badkalaami karey. (Bukhari: 34)"
"33","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo Lailat-ul-Qadr mein imaan aur sawaab ki niyat key sath qiyaam karey uskey pichhley gunaah maaf kar diye jaaengey. (Bukhari: 35)"
"34","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Abu Hurairah Raziallahu anhu se) Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Allah ne us shakhs key liye zimma liya hai jo uskey raastey mein nikley, usey sirf mujh par imaan aur merey Rasoolon ki tasdeeq nikaalti hai, ke main usey wapas karun uskey sath jo us ne ajr ya ganeemat mein se paaya, ya usey Jannat mein daakhil karun. Aur agar main apni ummat par mushakkat na samajhta to kisi lashkar key peechey na rehta, aur main chaahta hun ke main Allah key raastey mein qatl kiya jaaun phir zinda kiya jaaun phir qatl kiya jaaun phir zinda kiya jaaun phir qatl kiya jaaun. (Bukhari: 36)"
"35","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se bhi (Abu Hurairah Raziallahu anhu se) riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo Ramazan mein imaan aur sawaab ki niyat key sath qiyaam karey uskey pichhley gunaah maaf kar diye jaaengey. (Bukhari: 37)"
"36","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo Ramazan key rozey rakkhey imaan aur sawaab ki niyat key sath, uskey pichhley gunaah maaf kar diye jaaengey. (Bukhari: 38)"
"37","[AI-translation] Aur Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Beshak deen aasaan hai, aur jo shakhs deen mein sakhti karega to deen us par ghaalib aa jaaeyga. To seedhey raho aur qareeb raho aur khushkhabri do, aur subah aur shaam aur raat key kuchh hissey se madad lo. (Bukhari: 39)"
"38","[AI-translation] Bara bin Aazib (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab Madina tashreef laaey to sab se pehley Ansaar mein se apne daadaon ya farmaya: Apne khaaluon key paas utrey. Aur Aap ne Bait-ul-Maqdis ki taraf solah mahiney ya satrah mahiney namaz padhi, aur Aap ko pasand tha ke Aap ka qibla Bait (Kaaba) ki taraf ho. Aur Aap ne sab se pehli namaz jo padhi Asr ki namaz padhi, aur Aap key sath qaum ne namaz padhi. To Aap key sath namaz padhney walon mein se aik aadmi nikla aur aik masjid walon par guzra jabke wo ruku mein they. To us ne kaha: Main Allah ki qasam kha kar gawahi deta hun ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath Makkah ki taraf (munh kar key) namaz padhi hai. To wo jaisey they Bait (Kaaba) ki taraf ghoom gaey. Aur Yahood aur Ahle Kitaab khush huey they jab Aap Bait-ul-Maqdis ki taraf (munh kar key) namaz padhtey they. Phir jab Aap ne apna chehra Bait ki taraf pher liya to unhon-ne usey naapasand kya. (Bukhari: 40)"
"39","[AI-translation] Abu Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Jab banda Musalman ho jaey aur uska Islam achha ho to Allah us se har buraai mita deta hai jo us ne pehley ki thi. Aur uskey baad badla hai: Neki das guna se saat sau guna tak, aur buraai us jaisi, magar ye ke Allah us se darguzar farmaaey. (Bukhari: 41)"
"40","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) unkey paas daakhil huey jabke unkey paas aik aurat thi. Aap ne farmaya: Ye kaun hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Fulaan (aurat) hai, uski namaz ka zikr karti hain. Aap ne farmaya: Bas karo! Tum par utna laazim hai jitni tum taaqat rakhtey ho. To Allah ki qasam! Allah nahi uktaata yahan tak ke tum ukta jao. Aur Aap ko deen mein se sab se pasand wo tha jis par uska karney wala hamesha qaem rahey. (Bukhari: 43)"
"41","[AI-translation] Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Aag se wo niklega jis ne La ilaaha illallah kaha aur uskey dil mein jau key daaney key baraabar bhalai hogi. Aur aag se wo niklega jis ne La ilaaha illallah kaha aur uskey dil mein gehuun key daaney key baraabar bhalai hogi. Aur aag se wo niklega jis ne La ilaaha illallah kaha aur uskey dil mein zarrey key baraabar bhalai hogi. (Bukhari: 44)"
"42","[AI-translation] Umar bin Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Yahood mein se aik aadmi ne un se kaha: Ae Ameer-ul-Momineen! Tumhari kitaab mein aik aayat hai jisey tum padhtey ho, agar ham Yahood ki jamaat par naazil hoti to ham us din ko Eid bana letey. Unhon-ne kaha: Kaunsi aayat? Us ne kaha: (Aaj main ne tumharey liye tumhara deen mukammal kar diya aur tum par apni nemat poori kar di aur tumharey liye Islam ko deen bana kar raazi ho gaya). Umar ne kaha: Ham ne us din ko aur us jagah ko pehchaan liya hai jis mein wo Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par naazil hui jabke Aap Arafaat mein Jumuah key din khadey they. (Bukhari: 45)"
"43","[AI-translation] Talha bin Ubaidullah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, wo kehtey hain: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas Najd walon mein se aik aadmi aaya jabke uskey sar key baal bikhrey huey they, uski aawaaz ki goonj sunaai deti thi aur jo wo kehta tha samajh na aata tha, yahan tak ke wo qareeb hua to wo Islam key baarey mein poochh raha tha. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Din aur raat mein paanch namazein. To us ne kaha: Kya mujh par uskey siwa (kuchh) hai? Aap ne farmaya: Nahi, magar ye ke tum nafl padho. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aur Ramazan key rozey. Us ne kaha: Kya mujh par uskey siwa (kuchh) hai? Aap ne farmaya: Nahi, magar ye ke tum nafl rakkho. Us ne kaha: Aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us se zakat ka zikr kya. Us ne kaha: Kya mujh par uskey siwa (kuchh) hai? Aap ne farmaya: Nahi, magar ye ke tum nafl do. Us ne kaha: To wo aadmi peeth mor kar gaya jabke wo keh raha tha: Allah ki qasam! Main is par na zyada karunga aur na kam. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kaamyaab hua agar sachcha raha. (Bukhari: 46)"
"44","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo Musalman key janaazey key sath imaan aur sawaab ki niyat key sath chaley aur uskey sath rahey yahan tak ke us par namaz padhi jaey aur uskey dafan se faarigh ho, to beshak wo ajr mein se do qeeraat key sath laut-ta hai, har qeeraat Uhad (pahaad) jaisa hai. Aur jo us par namaz padhey phir dafan honay se pehley laut jaey to beshak wo aik qeeraat key sath laut-ta hai. (Bukhari: 47)"
"45","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Musalman ko gaali dena fisq hai aur us se qitaal karna kufr hai. (Bukhari: 48)"
"46","[AI-translation] Ubada bin Saamit (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Lailat-ul-Qadr ki khabar deney key liye nikley to Musalmaanon mein se do aadmi jhagad rahey they. To Aap ne farmaya: Beshak main tumhey Lailat-ul-Qadr ki khabar deney key liye nikla tha, aur fulaan aur fulaan jhagad padey to wo utha li gai. Aur ummeed hai ke wo tumharey liye behtar ho. Usey saatwein aur nawein aur paanchwein (raaton) mein talaash karo. (Bukhari: 49)"
"47","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aik din logon key saamney tashreef farma they ke Aap key paas Jibreel aey aur unhon-ne kaha: Imaan kya hai? Aap ne farmaya: Imaan ye hai ke tum Allah aur uskey farishton aur uski kitaabon aur us se mulaaqaat aur uskey Rasoolon par imaan laao, aur dobaara uthney par imaan laao. Unhon-ne kaha: Islam kya hai? Aap ne farmaya: Islam ye hai ke tum Allah ki ibaadat karo aur uskey sath kisi cheez ko shareek na karo, aur namaz qaem karo aur farz zakat ada karo aur Ramazan key rozey rakkho. Unhon-ne kaha: Ehsaan kya hai? Aap ne farmaya: Ye ke tum Allah ki ibaadat karo goya tum usey dekhtey ho, phir agar tum usey nahi dekhtey to beshak wo tumhey dekhta hai. Unhon-ne kaha: Qiyaamat kab hai? Aap ne farmaya: Jis se poochha gaya hai wo poochhney waley se zyada jaanney wala nahi hai. Aur main tumhey uski nishaaniyon key baarey mein bataaunga: Jab londi apne aaqa ko janey, aur jab oont charaaney waley naangey paon imaaraton mein fakhr karein. (Qiyaamat ka ilm) paanch (cheezon) mein hai jinhey Allah key siwa koi nahi jaanta. Phir Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne tilaawat ki: (Beshak Allah key paas Qiyaamat ka ilm hai) aayat. Phir wo peeth mor kar chaley gaey. To Aap ne farmaya: Usey wapas laao. To unhon-ne kuchh na dekha. To Aap ne farmaya: Ye Jibreel they, logon ko unka deen sikhaanay aey they. (Bukhari: 50)"
"48","[AI-translation] Noman bin Basheer (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, wo kehtey hain: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Halaal waazeh hai aur haraam waazeh hai, aur un donon key darmiyaan mushtabehaat (shubhey wali cheezein) hain jinhey logon mein se aksar nahi jaantey. Phir jo mushtabehaat se bacha us ne apne deen aur apni izzat ko mehfooz kar liya, aur jo shubhaat mein pada (uski misaal) aisey charwaahey ki hai jo (shaahi) hima key gird charaata hai, qareeb hai ke wo us mein pad jaey. Khabardaar! Beshak har baadshah ki aik hima hoti hai. Khabardaar! Beshak zameen mein Allah ki hima uski hurmatein (haraam ki hui cheezein) hain. Khabardaar! Beshak jism mein gosht ka aik tukda hai, jab wo durust ho to saara jism durust hota hai aur jab wo bigad jaey to saara jism bigad jaata hai. Khabardaar! Aur wo dil hai."
"49","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Beshak Abdul Qais ka wafd jab Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aaya to Aap ne farmaya: Qaum kaun hai ya wafd kaun hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Rabeeah. Aap ne farmaya: Qaum ya wafd ko khush aamdeed, na ruswa honay waley aur na sharminda honay waley. To unhon-ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak ham Aap key paas haraam mahiney key siwa nahi aa saktey, aur hamaarey aur Aap key darmiyaan Muzar key kaafiron ka ye qabeela hai. To hamein faisla kun baat ka hukm dijiye jiski ham apne peechhey walon ko khabar dein aur jis se ham Jannat mein daakhil hon. Aur unhon-ne Aap se mashroobaat key baarey mein poochha. To Aap ne unhey chaar (baaton) ka hukm diya aur unhey chaar (baaton) se mana kya. Unhey Allah Wahdah par imaan ka hukm diya aur farmaya: Kya tum jaantey ho Allah Wahdah par imaan kya hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Allah aur uska Rasool zyada jaanney waley hain. Aap ne farmaya: Is baat ki gawahi ke Allah key siwa koi mabood nahi aur Muhammad Allah key Rasool hain, aur namaz qaem karna aur zakat dena aur Ramazan key rozey rakhna aur ye ke tum maal-e-ganeemat mein se paanchwaan hissa do. Aur unhey chaar (bartanon) se mana kya: Hantam aur Dubba aur Naqeer aur Muzaffat se, aur baaz auqaat farmaya: Muqayyar se. Aur farmaya: Inhey yaad rakkho aur inki apne peechhey walon ko khabar do. (Bukhari: 53)"
"50","[AI-translation] Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak aamaal niyaton key sath hain. Aur ye kitaab key awwal mein guzar chuka hai aur yahaan Aap key qaul (beshak har shakhs key liye wahi hai jo us ne niyat ki) key baad itna izaafa kya: Phir jiski hijrat Allah aur uskey Rasool ki taraf ho to uski hijrat Allah aur uskey Rasool ki taraf hai. Aur baaqi hadees zikr ki. (Bukhari: 54)"
"51","[AI-translation] Abu Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Jab aadmi apne ghar walon par sawaab ki niyat key sath kharch karey to wo uskey liye sadqa hai. (Bukhari: 55)"
"52","[AI-translation] Jareer bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se namaz qaem karney aur zakat deney aur har Musalman ki khairkhwaahi par baiat ki. (Bukhari: 57)"
"53","[AI-translation] Jareer bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Amma baad! Beshak main Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aaya aur main ne kaha: Main Aap se Islam par baiat karta hun. To Aap ne mujh par shart lagaaee: Aur har Musalman ki khairkhwaahi (par). To main ne Aap se is par baiat ki. (Bukhari: 58). Kitaab-ul-Ilm."
